# Build artifacts
# Log directory (created by setup.sh tmux fallback)
# Pipeline job data + SQLite database (runtime-generated, not source)
# Python virtual environment (created by setup.sh)
# Runtime artifacts
# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.
# Skills directory
# ad-hoc QA/verification screenshots (agent-generated, not source)
# dataset-v3 build: large scraped/annotated data (scripts tracked, data not)
# dataset-v3: secret + more large data (added after gitignore was reverted mid-session)
# debug
# dependencies
# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
# generated shared secret for pipeline-service auth (see start.sh) — must
# lock file for start-services.sh's flock guard against overlapping runs
# misc
# never be committed, one is generated per-deployment on first run
# next.js
# production
# stray media / scratch
# testing
# typescript
# vercel
